  "node_type": "statement",
  "body": {
    "id": "prop:two-record-exact-audit",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "In the specified experiment \\((\\mathcal Z_k^2,\\overline\\Pi_{s,k}^{\\,2})\\), \\(\\Pr(\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{coll}})=1/k\\) and \\(\\operatorname{TV}(\\overline\\Pi_{+,k}^{\\,2},\\overline\\Pi_{-,k}^{\\,2})=4ab/k\\). With equal prior weights on \\(s\\), \\(RR_{2,k}\\) has Bayes classification error \\(\\{1-(4ab/k)\\tanh(\\epsilon/2)\\}/2\\), and \\(\\widehat\\theta_{\\mathrm{RR}}\\) has Bayes absolute risk \\[\\frac{ab}{1/4-a^2}\\{1-(4ab/k)\\tanh(\\epsilon/2)\\}.\\] For every adjacent pair under \\(\\sim_{\\mathrm q}\\), both output likelihood ratios are at most \\(e^\\epsilon\\), and the maximum neighboring log-likelihood ratio is exactly \\(\\epsilon\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
      "Z_k",
      "Pi_quant_s_2",
      "E_collision",
